### Key Usage Notes

**Pattern 1:** On this pageOverviewChat ModelCreate Chat ModelCall Chat ModelGenerate Structured OutputFormatterCustom ProviderStep 1: Define the CredentialStep 2...

```
import os
from agentscope.model import DashScopeChatModel
from agentscope.credential import DashScopeCredential

model = DashScopeChatModel(
    credential=DashScopeCredential(api_key=os.environ["DASHSCOPE_API_KEY"]),
    model="qwen-plus",
    stream=True,
)
```

